    {
      "@id": "urn:oslo-toolchain:130e6383e8cbc25acbf09c99a5dadb7c85eac421a63a2f5b80156cc5f693b550",
      "@type": "Class",
      "apDefinition": [
        {
          "@language": "nl",
          "@value": "Klasse die kenmerken van instanties van om het even welk type vertegenwoordigt."
        },
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "Class representing characteristics of instances of any type."
        }
      ],
      "apLabel": [
        {
          "@language": "nl",
          "@value": "Kenmerktype"
        },
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "Feature type"
        }
      ],
      "apUsageNote": [
        {
          "@language": "nl",
          "@value": "In de context van Observaties en Metingen is dit een kenmerk van het geobseveerdObject (of van het bemonsterdObject of een onderdeel daarvan) en in principe van alle instanties van dat type geobserveerdObject. Bv Lichaamstemperatuur, Lithologie, ChemischeSamenstelling (resp van een Persoon, een GeologischeEenheid en - meer indirect - van een Monster genomen op een bepaalde plek in een Rivier). Substitueren door een <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/skos-reference/#Concept\">skos:Concept</a> OF een instantie van een equivalente klasse bvb <a href=\"https://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind\">qudt:QuantityKind</a> OF eigen subklasse."
        },
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "In the context of Observations and Measurements, this is a characteristic of the obsessed Object (or of the sampled Object or a part thereof) and in principle of all instances of that type of observed Object. E.g. Body Temperature, Lithology, Chemical Composition (respectively from a Person, a Geological Unit and - more indirectly - from a Sample taken at a certain place in a River). Substitution by a <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/skos-reference/#Concept\">skos:Concept</a> OR an instance of an equivalent class e.g. <a href=\"https://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind\">qudt:QuantityKind</a> OR own subclass."
        }
      ],
      "assignedURI": "http://def.isotc211.org/iso19109/2005/GeneralFeatureModel#GF_PropertyType",
      "diagramLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "Kenmerktype"
        }
      ],
      "scope": "https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/scope/External",
      "status": "https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/OntwerpStandaard",
      "vocLabel": [
        {
          "@language": "nl",
          "@value": "Kenmerktype"
        },
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "Feature type"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:oslo-toolchain:fb06224fbd9fc5831e2edd0ba024950f8fb9509da68ade7c8d9c506279a86262",
      "@type": "Class",
      "apUsageNote": [
        {
          "@language": "nl",
          "@value": "DATEX Verkeerssituatie is de superklasse van alle soorten situaties in het verkeer die de DATEX II standaard beschrijft. Deze kan worden vervangen door o.a. File, Ongeval, etc. <a href =\"https://docs.datex2.eu/\">Meer informatie over DATEX II</a>."
        },
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "DATEX Traffic situation is the superclass of all types of traffic situations that the DATEX II standard describes. This can be replaced by File, Accident, etc. <a href=\"https://docs.datex2.eu/\">More information about DATEX II.</a>"
        }
      ],
      "assignedURI": "http://datex2.eu/vocab/3/Situation#Situation",
      "diagramLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "Verkeerssituatie"
        }
      ],
      "parent": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:oslo-toolchain:c03be8a6cb31eaf3a661d6b0c5c5da28d48df28bcf09ce41ef1e2e2c90917cb9"
        }
      ],
      "scope": "https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/scope/External",
      "status": "https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/OntwerpStandaard",
      "vocDefinition": [
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "An identifiable instance of a traffic/travel situation comprising one or more traffic/travel circumstances which are linked by one or more causal relationships. Each traffic/travel circumstance is represented by a Situation Record."
        },
        {
          "@language": "nl",
          "@value": "Een verzameling van verkeersomstandigheden die een bepaalde situatie in het verkeer verklaren zoals file, ongeval, etc."
        },
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "An identifiable instance of a traffic/travel situation comprising one or more traffic/travel circumstances which are linked by one or more causal relationships. Each traffic/travel circumstance is represented by a Situation Record."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:oslo-toolchain:c746e7a68c36e3b189a7f98ae02de3fff89d62256868bb8911fc00cffd830646",
      "@type": "Class",
      "apUsageNote": [
        {
          "@language": "nl",
          "@value": "Dit is het werkelijk geobserveerdObject. Als rechtstreeks observeren niet kan observeren we een representatief staal, het zgn Bemonsteringsobject. In dat geval is het Domeinobject het bemonsterdObject. OPMERKING: Deze klasse is louter informatief, in praktijk moet ze gesubstitueerd worden door een klasse uit het domein. Bv in het domein Waterkwaliteit zou het domeinobject een instantie vd klasse Rivier kunnen zijn. Meer info over deze klasse in applicatieprofiel <a href=\"https://data.vlaanderen.be/doc/applicatieprofiel/besluit-mobiliteit/\">Besluit Mobiliteit</a>."
        },
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "This is the actual observed object. If direct observation is not possible, we observe a representative sample, the so-called Sampling Object. In that case, the Domain Object is the sampledObject. NOTE: This class is purely informative, in practice it must be substituted by a class from the domain. E.g. in the Water Quality domain, the domain object could be an instance of the class River. More information about this class in the application profile <a href=\"https://data.vlaanderen.be/doc/applicatieprofiel/besluit-mobiliteit/\">Mobility Decree</a>."
        }
      ],
      "assignedURI": "https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit#Mobiliteitshinder",
      "diagramLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "Mobiliteitshinder"
        }
      ],
      "parent": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:oslo-toolchain:c03be8a6cb31eaf3a661d6b0c5c5da28d48df28bcf09ce41ef1e2e2c90917cb9"
        }
      ],
      "scope": "https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/scope/inPublicationNamespace",
      "status": "https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/OntwerpStandaard",
      "vocDefinition": [
        {
          "@language": "nl",
          "@value": "Verstoring van de normale mobiliteit op het openbaar domein of privé domein met openbaar karakter."
        },
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "Disruption of normal mobility on the public domain or private domain of a public nature."
        }
      ],
      "vocLabel": [
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "Mobility Hindrance"
        },
        {
          "@language": "nl",
          "@value": "Mobiliteitshinder"
        },
        {
          "@language": "en",
          "@value": "Mobility Hindrance"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:oslo-toolchain:5f5a13564cf762a41dcb8b0976a3b1343f191ccbfda0b4bdb0cef830de959149",
      "@type": "Class",
